Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stage timeline and ready window for a start time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/0c5dadaa-7cbf-4ca2-91e2-82f2eeae1ad2/timeline?start=2026-11-26T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

